Dev briefing:
Description:

Lenny's code
<style>
/* 1 — unhide (unchanged, this is working) */
#yotpo-reviews-main-widget .yotpo-paragraph-summary-container,
#yotpo-reviews-main-widget .yotpo-media-gallery-container {
  display: block !important;
}

/* 2 — flex the unclassed wrapper.
   :where() adds no specificity, so every rule below resolves cleanly:
   the catch-all lands at (1,1,0) and each order rule at (1,2,0). */
#yotpo-reviews-main-widget .yotpo-main-layout > :where(div:not([class]), div:has(> .yotpo-reviews-container)) {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}

/* 3 — catch-all: (1,1,0) */
#yotpo-reviews-main-widget .yotpo-main-layout > :where(div:not([class]), div:has(> .yotpo-reviews-container)) > * { order: 99; }

/* 4 — order values: (1,2,0), so these win */
#yotpo-reviews-main-widget .yotpo-main-layout > :where(div:not([class]), div:has(> .yotpo-reviews-container)) > [class*='yotpo-review-border-']    { order: 0; }
#yotpo-reviews-main-widget .yotpo-main-layout > :where(div:not([class]), div:has(> .yotpo-reviews-container)) > .yotpo-paragraph-summary-container { order: 1; }
#yotpo-reviews-main-widget .yotpo-main-layout > :where(div:not([class]), div:has(> .yotpo-reviews-container)) > .yotpo-media-gallery-container     { order: 2; }
#yotpo-reviews-main-widget .yotpo-main-layout > :where(div:not([class]), div:has(> .yotpo-reviews-container)) > .yotpo-header-container            { order: 3; }
#yotpo-reviews-main-widget .yotpo-main-layout > :where(div:not([class]), div:has(> .yotpo-reviews-container)) > .yotpo-filters-container           { order: 4; }
#yotpo-reviews-main-widget .yotpo-main-layout > :where(div:not([class]), div:has(> .yotpo-reviews-container)) > .yotpo-reviews-container           { order: 5; }

/* Title → AI summary: trim the headline's bottom margin.
   Scoped to l/m because display-s has no bottom margin to trim. */
#yotpo-reviews-main-widget.yotpo-display-l .yotpo-main-layout .yotpo-head,
#yotpo-reviews-main-widget.yotpo-display-m .yotpo-main-layout .yotpo-head {
  margin-bottom: 24px;
}

/* Space above stars & score. No existing margin here — this is new. */
#yotpo-reviews-main-widget .yotpo-header-container {
  margin-top: 48px;
}

#yotpo-reviews-main-widget.yotpo-display-s .yotpo-header-container {
  margin-top: 32px;
}
</style>




Targeting:

All PDP's

⚠️ EXCLUDE the new language-specific sites we have e.g.  

/de-de/
/de-at
/de-ch
/fr-fr/
/es-es/
/fr-ch/


% Split Requirements

50/50



Runtime:

3 weeks

